H["Human authority"]:::human
DI["Design intelligence<br/>human • frontier model • Reverend Architect"]:::human
SP["Accepted SpecificationPackage<br/>or objective-driven Run"]:::authority
EDGE["Private authenticated edge<br/>Tailscale/TLS + /api/v1 + SSE"]:::security
CP["Persistent Control Plane<br/>PostgreSQL authority"]:::authority
ORCH["Executive Orchestrator<br/>Run → Workflow → Task → Agent/Team"]:::agent
CTX["Context Broker"]:::context
RI["Repository Intelligence<br/>symbols • LSP • graphs • exact retrieval"]:::context
RF["Research Fabric<br/>search • APIs • HTTP • browser • evidence"]:::context
MEM["Artifacts • Evidence • Memory"]:::durable
MF["Model Fabric<br/>ModelRequirement → Router → DeploymentProfile"]:::agent
POL["Policy • Tool • Secret Brokers"]:::security
SCHED["Workflow + Compute Schedulers<br/>Capacity Controller"]:::authority
CPU["CPU worker<br/>build • test • index • LSP"]:::compute
BR["Browser worker<br/>research • frontend test"]:::compute
GPU["Model GPU worker<br/>vLLM • Qwen baseline"]:::compute
SPEC["Future specialized workers<br/>scientific GPU • media/asset GPU"]:::compute
DET["Deterministic verification<br/>tests • compilers • benchmarks • simulations • Git/CI"]:::verify
REC["Durable execution<br/>Action Journal • checkpoints • recovery"]:::durable
COST["Cost / budgets / observability"]:::durable
OUT["Verified reviewable engineering result"]:::authority

